- mobile remains good;
- cross-device history remains authoritative.

C. RESUME PILLOW INTELLIGENCE CERTIFICATION
- materially new unseen cases;
- preserve consumed failures;
- do not weaken criteria to obtain a pass.

D. PERMANENT SUPERVISION IMPLEMENTATION/CERTIFICATION
- continuous sentinels;
- Work six-hour assurance;
- dead-man monitoring;
- independent commerce/financial/transaction controls;
- failure-injection evidence.

E. OWNER UX CLOSURE
- unified owner operating system;
- executive dashboard;
- Work/Pillow visibility;
- Money/Orders/Health/Blind Spots;
- real scoped owner controls;
- remove/rationalise development clutter;
- Executive Home ↔ Pillow continuity.

F. ONLY AFTER REQUIRED SAFETY/CERTIFICATION/AUTHORITY GATES
- separately seek King's explicit decision regarding Birth and/or commerce commissioning.

Do not infer Birth or commerce permission from this roadmap.

==================================================

45. AUTONOMY EXPECTATION
==================================================

Continue autonomously through bounded durable checkpoints.

Do not stop merely to narrate progress.

Do not return to King for routine engineering choices that fall within the authority above.

Return to King only when genuinely necessary for matters such as:

- protected credential provision that cannot safely be completed otherwise;
- new material spending authority;
- Birth;
- commerce unlock;
- material financial/risk decision;
- destructive or irreversible action outside standing authority;
- unresolved owner-visible acceptance that only King can judge;
- a genuine external blocker requiring owner intervention.

If one path is blocked, continue all independent safe work rather than waiting idle.

Persist and read back canonical handoffs at meaningful checkpoints.

==================================================

