BLOCKED
NEXT EXECUTABLE ITEMS
KING ACTION REQUIRED

Also provide mission-level open/proven/block counts by phase.

The matrix is a mission-control instrument, NOT a reason to pause implementation. Build/reconcile it and continue engineering in this SAME run.

==================================================

4. DESKTOP PILLOW OWNER ACCEPTANCE REMAINS OPEN
==================================================

The latest owner screenshot shows that the earlier sidebar-overlap/clipping defect appears materially improved.

However, DESKTOP PILLOW ACCEPTANCE REMAINS FAILED/OPEN.

