9. FAILED-PROVIDER ACCOUNTING — KEEP PUSHING
==================================================

Accounting remains unresolved because the available ledger predates the failed attempt.

Do not stop at that observation.

Search all available authoritative sources for evidence of the consumed attempt, including where applicable:
- runtime persistence;
- inference-request records;
- spending/reservation state;
- provider receipts/metadata;
- application logs;
- deployment/runtime logs;
- durable accounting files;
- provider-side evidence accessible without exposing secrets.

